# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# Astro's `redirects` config emits meta-refresh HTML pages, which browsers
# follow but search engines treat as soft redirects that pass link equity
# poorly. These rules give the same routes a real HTTP 301 on Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The Astro-generated pages remain as a fallback for any other host.

/about-5     /about/   301
/about-5/    /about/   301
/projects    /blog/    301
/projects/   /blog/    301
